rows.en:
I got thirsty, so I came to Silver Moon
for some tea, but it's boring all alone,
so I was kinda at a loss, see.

(But if she came up with a good idea,
I guess the walk was a nice change of pace
for Hoshimura too?)

(But if she came up with a good idea,
I guess the walk was a nice change of pace
for Yui too?)
